# Testing

- Prefer tests for money, stock, auth, compatibility, and webhooks over cosmetic UI snapshots.
- CompatibilityEngine, cart pricing, coupons, inventory, Stripe webhook, auth/RBAC, abandoned-cart job, order creation = **required** coverage by Phase 17 (add earlier when the module lands).
- Unit-test pure domain logic; integration-test Prisma + services; E2E for checkout/builder smoke.
- Do not merge Phase work that breaks existing tests — fix before finishing.
- No tests that assert on leaked internal error strings.
